    networking: manage network availability and inventory
    
    Add administrator availability controls with current capability metadata.
    Keep disabled owned addresses visible without assignment actions and use
    optional enabled-network filters for new assignment selectors.
    
    Display authoritative available and owned-unassigned network counts with
    bilingual keyboard descriptions. Keep the editor's owned total separate
    and new statistics optional for older APIs. Warn only on explicit disabled
    state in desktop and mobile admin IP flags, preserving service links.
    
    Document REQ-071 and the REQ-050 extension with the API and workflow
    contracts, synthetic unit coverage and bilingual browser scenarios.

